higher S&P scores on short-form PopQA, which is consistent with Menick et al. (2022). Human annotators also find ISREL and ISSUP reflection token predictions are mostly aligned with their assessments. Appendix Table 6 shows several annotated examples and explanations on assessments. 6 C ONCLUSION This work introduces SELF -RAG, a new framework to enhance the quality and factuality of LLMs through retrieval on demand and self-reflection. SELF -R AG trains an LM to learn to retrieve, generate, and critique text passages and its own generation by predicting the next tokens from its original vocabulary as well as newly added special tokens, called refl
